obs The hot endurance run reads 307 green and 14 red. Two are this round's own and both are answered: fold_shelf_link_repoint caught my new shelf carrying the card's depth on a link the elder account brought with it, repaired by the tool that owns it and green after; remember_git_nib resolves at the commit. The other twelve were each read again with this round's whole set stashed and answered the same verdict, so they are peer ratchets this cycle raised and they are surfaced rather than claimed.
